---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---
<section aria-label="Pengantar NurturaMom" data-reveal>
  <div class="relative flex min-h-[92svh] items-center overflow-hidden bg-[#FFF4EC] md:min-h-[86vh]">
    <img
      src="/img/img.webp"
      alt="Bidan mendampingi ibu hamil"
      class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover object-[70%_center]"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFFCF8] via-[#FFFCF8]/92 via-55% to-[#FFFCF8]/5"
      aria-hidden="true"
    ></div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-28 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#FFFCF8] to-transparent"
      aria-hidden="true"
    ></div>

    <div class="container-nm relative z-10 w-full py-16 md:py-20">
      <div class="max-w-[560px]">
        <h1 class="text-balance text-[clamp(2.3rem,6vw,3.9rem)] font-extrabold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.025em] text-[#5A6E64]">
          <span data-i18n="hero.t1">Teman Sehat</span>
          <span class="relative mt-1 block w-fit text-[#AE6B82]">
            <span data-i18n="hero.t2">Ibu dan Anak</span>
            <svg class="absolute -bottom-2 left-0 w-[min(200px,75%)]" viewBox="0 0 220 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" preserveAspectRatio="none">
              <path d="M4 8C60 2 160 2 216 7" stroke="#EFD0D6" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </h1>
        <p data-i18n="hero.sub" class="mt-5 max-w-[440px] text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#3D2B30]/80">
          Informasi kesehatan terpercaya untuk menemani setiap tahap perjalanan menjadi ibu. Dari tes positif sampai anak usia 5 tahun.
        </p>

        <form
          action="/cari"
          method="get"
          role="search"
          class="mt-6 flex max-w-[480px] items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white p-2 pl-4 shadow-[0_16px_44px_rgba(88,41,58,0.16)] ring-1 ring-[#F3E6DD] transition focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-[#9C3D5C]/40"
        >
          <Icon name="lucide:search" class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#8A7A7E]" />
          <label for="q" class="sr-only" data-i18n="hero.ph">Cari informasi kesehatan</label>
          <input
            id="q"
            name="q"
            type="search"
            data-i18n-ph="hero.ph"
            placeholder="Cari informasi kesehatan..."
            autocomplete="off"
            class="w-full bg-transparent text-sm text-[#3D2B30] placeholder:text-[#8A7A7E] focus:outline-none"
          />
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-[#7C9D8B] px-7 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-[#6B8C7A] active:scale-[0.98]"
            data-i18n="hero.btn"
          >
            Cari
          </button>
        </form>
        <div class="mt-3.5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs text-[#3D2B30]/70">
          <span data-i18n="hero.pop">Populer:</span>
          <a data-i18n="hero.pop1" class="whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-[#F3E6DD] bg-white/80 px-3 py-1 font-medium backdrop-blur hover:border-[#9C3D5C] hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/kalender-kehamilan">HPL</a>
          <a data-i18n="hero.pop2" class="whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-[#F3E6DD] bg-white/80 px-3 py-1 font-medium backdrop-blur hover:border-[#9C3D5C] hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/kehamilan">Trimester 2</a>
          <a data-i18n="hero.pop3" class="whitespace-nowrap rounded-full border border-[#F3E6DD] bg-white/80 px-3 py-1 font-medium backdrop-blur hover:border-[#9C3D5C] hover:text-[#9C3D5C]" href="/tools/imunisasi">Imunisasi BCG</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a
      href="#topik"
      aria-label="Lihat topik kesehatan"
      class="no-print absolute bottom-5 left-1/2 z-10 hidden -translate-x-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-1 text-[#3D2B30]/50 transition hover:text-[#9C3D5C] md:flex"
    >
      <span class="text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Jelajahi</span>
      <span class="grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#3D2B30]/15 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur motion-safe:animate-bounce">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6" />
        </svg>
      </span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
